              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Rhienzi"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This may be the best batch of Hermit cookies I have ever made, and I have made several different recipes. \n I did change a couple of things. I didn’t have allspice so I used 2tsp of apple pie spice instead of the listed spices and I added a handful of chopped dates, and a hand full of sweetened coconut, Just because I had them on hand.",
