            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tania"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The first time I ever heard of Hermit Cookies was in Grade 7 Home Economics. Everyone loved them, especially my mom. I didn't change a thing in this recipe - these cookies turned out perfect, just as old-fashioned and wholesome tasting as I remember. Thank you, Dawn, for posting this recipe and sending me down memory lane, in a delicious way!",
